  unitName: Frost Harp Soleil
  unitId: 20804
  unitNumber: 1372
  description: One of the women who served the goddess Felice, a member of the Divine
    Ten. She mastered symphomancy, the art of weaving magic into music to control
    minds. When she played the zither she could soothe even the most savage beast.
    Taking a different path from her two sisters, she traveled the world, spreading
    her faith in the goddess, Felice. There were many people who found faith in the
    goddess from the hymns she sang.
  summonDesc: I was brought here by a melody.<br>Just how will my music sound under
    your direction...?
  fusionDesc: The murmur that reaches my ears is the sound that echoes in your heart.
    This sound...is a wave of strength
